    "Asks for confirmation, then erases all progress" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fragt nach Bestätigung und löscht dann den gesamten Fortschritt"
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pide confirmación y luego borra todo tu progreso"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Demande confirmation, puis efface toute la progression"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "確認後、すべての進行状況を消去します"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "확인 후 모든 진행 상황을 지워요"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pede confirmação e depois apaga todo o progresso"
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cere confirmare, apoi șterge tot progresul"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "确认后清除所有进度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At %lld m, then every %lld m and after every boss. Perks last until the run ends. Most can be taken again to stack." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bei %lld m, dann alle %lld m und nach jedem Boss. Perks halten bis zum Rundenende. Die meisten lassen sich mehrfach nehmen und stapeln."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "At %1$lld m, then every %2$lld m and after every boss. Perks last until the run ends. Most can be taken again to stack."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A los %lld m, luego cada %lld m y después de cada jefe. Las ventajas duran hasta que acaba la partida. La mayoría se pueden tomar otra vez para acumularse."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "À %lld m, puis tous les %lld m et après chaque boss. Les atouts durent jusqu'à la fin de la partie. La plupart peuvent être repris pour se cumuler."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld mで、その後は%2$lld mごとと各ボス撃破後に獲得。パークはプレイ終了まで有効で、多くは重ねがけできます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld m에서, 이후 %lld m마다 그리고 보스를 쓰러뜨릴 때마다. 특성은 판이 끝날 때까지 유지돼요. 대부분 다시 골라 중첩할 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aos %lld m, depois a cada %lld m e após cada chefe. As vantagens duram até o fim da partida. A maioria pode ser pega de novo para acumular."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La %lld m, apoi la fiecare %lld m și după fiecare șef. Atuurile țin până la finalul turei. Majoritatea pot fi luate din nou ca să se cumuleze."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在%lld m时出现，之后每%lld m及每次击败BOSS后出现。天赋持续到本局结束，大多可重复选择叠加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At the very bottom of everything, something is swallowing the stars." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ganz unten, unter allem, verschlingt etwas die Sterne."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hasta el fondo de todo, algo se está tragando las estrellas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tout au fond de tout, quelque chose avale les étoiles."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "すべての最深部で、何かが星を飲み込んでいる。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "모든 것의 맨 밑바닥에서 무언가가 별을 삼키고 있어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lá no fundo de tudo, algo está engolindo as estrelas."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La fundul fundului, ceva înghite stelele."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在万物的最深处，有东西正在吞噬星辰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
